    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522550/extras/7633b24446c0e1208973a15c92a0b872.poster.avif?t=1693522414\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522550/extras/7633b24446c0e1208973a15c92a0b872.webm?t=1693522414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522550/extras/7633b24446c0e1208973a15c92a0b872.mp4?t=1693522414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong> Mini Garden Cafe is a cute and simple relaxation game where you make and sell coffee, bread, and plants to expand your shop and fill up a Dex.</strong><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple Cooking System<br></li><li>100 types of bread<br></li><li>100 types of coffee<br></li><li>100 types of plants<br></li><li>Upgrades and floor expansion elements<br></li><li>Beautiful and intensely colored visuals<br></li><li>Comfortable and relaxing OST<br></li><li>16 to 32 hours of playtime<br></li><li>Awesome spaceship launch system!<br></li><li>Cool excavators too!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522550/extras/7df64a3a7cea91e116a2d06936cf59fc.poster.avif?t=1693522414\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522550/extras/7df64a3a7cea91e116a2d06936cf59fc.webm?t=1693522414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522550/extras/7df64a3a7cea91e116a2d06936cf59fc.mp4?t=1693522414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
